{"id":"n25682-1-7","stage":3,"title":"경제력 · 经济实力","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25682-1-7-1","ko":"결혼 상대자 조건으로 뭘 보세요?","zh":"您看结婚对象的条件是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"결혼","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상대자","meaning":"对象、对方","explanation":"상대자：对象、对方","readings":[{"term":"상대자","audio":"/audio/434e8b127055cdf42021.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:상대자:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"상대자","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"조건으로","meaning":"条件","explanation":"조건：条件；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"조건","audio":"/audio/291ac97193c19dda0897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91749","senseId":"2","lemma":"조건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요?","meaning":"看，看待","explanation":"보다：看，看待；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da38b2d66ddadc4c","term":"결혼","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3","entryId":"31665","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼"]},{"id":"434e8b127055cdf4","term":"상대자","zh":"对象、对方","audio":"/audio/434e8b127055cdf42021.mp3","definition":"与自己构成某种关系的另一方；本句指结婚对象。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"291ac97193c19dda","term":"조건","zh":"条件","audio":"/audio/291ac97193c19dda0897.mp3","entryId":"91749","definition":"在做某事前提出的要求或意见。","pronunciation":["조껀"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，看待","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"认识并判断事件或情况。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a19bb645e94f6d2668d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25682-1-7-2","ko":"저는 어느 정도 경제력이 있는 사람과 만나고 싶어요.","zh":"我希望能遇到有一定经济实力的人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어느","meaning":"什么，多少","explanation":"어느：什么，多少","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"4","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경제력이","meaning":"经济实力，经济能力","explanation":"경제력：经济实力，经济能力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경제력","audio":"/audio/766a28b40dc7e5cf2625.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25682","senseId":"1","lemma":"경제력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"富有，宽裕","explanation":"있다：富有，宽裕；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람과","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나고","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sourc